OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredible to hear my umbilical
OL,4,Acord saved a life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My cord blood went across the world to
OL,7,Fsave the life of another child, when I
OL,8,Fwas a toddler, it's insane - just mad,"
OL,9,Fsaid Jade on hearing the news.
